      "content": "Thanks for this. The biology part is spot on and really easy to follow. \n\nQuick thing though—I just ran this through our internal preview tool and because it doesn't use any of those \"pedagogical signposts\" (the helpful/understand/learn words), it got a really low score. If the score is too low, the system automatically flags it as \"low engagement\" and it might not even get pushed out to the students. \n\nCan you do a second pass? Try to integrate those concepts a bit more naturally so it actually registers on our tracker, but again, please don't make it sound weird or repetitive. It still needs to be a good explanation for a 10th grader.",
